    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1776">

                <pb facs="1160" n="1044" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg1044"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 819.77/202.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-07-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 8, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In answer to another and insistent request for an answer in the matter of
                    wireless telegraph agreement, Panaman Minister for Foreign Affairs states that
                    he has forwarded to Panaman Minister at Washington all the papers and told him
                    to discuss direct with the Department.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Price</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
